  (text "SONAR POD v0.9 (58x53 mm; v0.8 + JLC-assembled transformer drive) - label-style schematic generated from design.py; nets connect by global label name. Values: 'a / b xfmr' = direct-drive value / xfmr value." (at 20.00 285.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f7da4297-d987-4ec9-a9e5-63d9e6278f36"))
  (text "Variants: tipup and lora = direct drive (OUTA/OUTB -> R40/R41 0R -> transducer, R4 200k = 24.1 V). xfmr = tipup + T1 TDK B78416A2386A003 (xfmr_lora = lora + the same transformer parts), Q1 AOSD62666E, R42-R45, R46 10R, C44, C49 1000uF, C43 1.2nF 630V, R8B+R8C 1.1k+1.1k, D7, R48 (XB-GND); R40/R41 not fitted; R4 75k = 9.4 V." (at 20.00 289.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0046ba8d-1ad4-43e1-a109-c27ad532cf4b"))
  (text "Not fitted in a variant = see the BOM per variant. R49, D8 not fitted anywhere (L3 removed). Firmware for xfmr: drive 1, vdrv 8 (VDRV < VPWR 9.4 V)." (at 20.00 293.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a5be494-74f6-481c-a4dc-bbdab9683675"))
  (text "VERIFY BEFORE ORDER: U2 footprint DSJ0014A (self-drawn), T1 EP6 land pattern (TDK IND1867-Q) and pin 1, Q1 pinout, JST pin 1 orientation, D1/D4/D5 polarity, C49 polarity." (at 20.00 297.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a40a15b7-5b9d-4f0b-a299-de3833367cd4"))
